{"id":"d3150da906872e7c","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-simple-type-semantics-compat.md","title":"simple-type-semantics — Compatibility alias","display":"simple-type-semantics — Compatibility alias","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-simple-type-semantics-compat","aliases":["16-df-simple-type-semantics-compat","16-simple-type-semantics"],"display":"simple-type-semantics — Compatibility alias","depends_on":["[[16-df-simple-type-semantics]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-simple-type-semantics-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-simple-type-semantics-compat</span><span>16-simple-type-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"simple-type-semantics — Compatibility alias"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"923cb52a5ddfc2cd\" href=\"?note=923cb52a5ddfc2cd\" title=\"16-df-simple-type-semantics\">16-df-simple-type-semantics</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> (笛卡尔闭范畴)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"923cb52a5ddfc2cd\" href=\"?note=923cb52a5ddfc2cd\" title=\"16-df-simple-type-semantics\">16-df-simple-type-semantics</a> 所引用的简单类型签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(\\mathcal C,\\Theta,\\rho,\\kappa)\">\\(M=(\\mathcal C,\\Theta,\\rho,\\kappa)\\)</span> 满足该页的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma(M)\">\\(\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma(M)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_M\">\\(⟦-⟧_M\\)</span> 是该页的递归类型、语境与良型项解释；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_M\">\\(⟦-⟧^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_M\\)</span> 是本页定义的兼容记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}type\\text{-}semantics\\text{-}legacy}\\vdash\n⟦-⟧^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_M\n\\coloneqq⟦-⟧_M.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}simple\\text{-}type\\text{-}semantics\\text{-}legacy}\\vdash\n⟦-⟧^{\\mathrm{legacy}}_M\n\\coloneqq⟦-⟧_M.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>类型、语境与项的规范 CCC 解释见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"923cb52a5ddfc2cd\" href=\"?note=923cb52a5ddfc2cd\" title=\"16-df-simple-type-semantics\">16-df-simple-type-semantics</a>。</li>\n<li>解释依赖整个模型记录，包括基类型赋值与常量箭头，不能只用底层范畴下标确定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-simple-type-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"923cb52a5ddfc2cd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-simple-type-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-simple-type-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"923cb52a5ddfc2cd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ 是 [[16-df-simple-type-semantics]] 所引用的简单类型签名，$M=(\\mathcal C,\\Theta,\\rho,\\kappa)$ 满足该页的 $\\mathsf{STLCMod}_\\Sigma(M)$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-simple-type-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"923cb52a5ddfc2cd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"类型、语境与项的规范 CCC 解释见 [[16-df-simple-type-semantics]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":fals